A||||4||contra||How do i tighten my alternator belt?||||1||
Z||000000||contra||07-16-2000||02:52 PM||||Yes i know, it's a simple question, but <BR>since i'm still an amatuer mechanic, i need to know. It really squeeking like crazy whenever it rains, but it's only a little chrip when it's warm and dry out. But i'd rather it make no sound at all. I got some of that spray that stops belt squeeking, but it only works for a couple days.<BR>i hope i dont have to replace the belt, it looks pretty tough. I have extra pullies if it's a warped pully too.||||reg||1
Z||000001||bcibob670||07-16-2000||03:04 PM||||determine how many belts you  have on the engine and look to see what those belts are supporting (like A/c , air pump, alternator )   .   usually the belts can be tightened at the device driven by the belt.  <P>my 4 cyl 86 had two belts one on the alternator/water pump and one on the waterpump/AC .    the water pumps bracket doesn adjust nor does the drive/main pulley. so I adjust the alternator pulley or the Ac pulley .   I use a torque wrench inserted in the brackett to make the belt tight and then sock up the holding nuts. ||||reg||3
Z||000002||StuGood||07-16-2000||03:18 PM||||Strange - this subject has never come up before.  No one I ever heard of has ever had any trouble with loose Fiero belts.  Although my Fiero belt and T-shirt are both getting a little tight lately   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">.  Maybe they're shrinking...<P>Actually, you've got plenty of company.  Do a search using "belt" in the subject line, and spend the rest of the day reading threads.<P>    ||||reg||12
Z||000003||contra||07-16-2000||05:46 PM||||okay thanx<BR>i'm going to go out there after dinner and see if i can just tighten everything up and give it a whirl around the neighborhood.<BR>i just hope i can squeeze my hand inside enough to tighten everything, it looks cramped in there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||07-17-2000||01:14 PM||||replace the belts. once a belt starts making noise it's shot. ||||reg||1
